 # general loadings. Per obs the block accrues hηη·zη zηᵀ + hηψ·(zη zψᵀ+zψ zηᵀ)
 # + hψψ·zψ zψᵀ; the canonical loadings recover the (ηη, ηψ, ψψ) layout.
